  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bist&#xE5;ndssamordn Skopje</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-ordinator Skopje</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida will appoint a Swedish cooperation coordinator for Swedish support to Kosovo/former Jugoslavia, Macedonia and Albania for 12 months, who will be placed at the Swedish Embassy in Belgrad. This appointment is due to the increased necessity for Swedish presence in the region after the war in Kosovo. Sida-support:SEK 1 825 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tidsbegr&#xE4;nsat (12 m&#xE5;n) f&#xF6;rordnande avseende handl&#xE4;ggare/bist&#xE5;nds- samordnare f&#xF6;r svenskt bist&#xE5;nd till Kosovo/FRJ, Makedonien och Albanien vid ambassaden i Belgrad med placering i Skopje, Makedonien. Detta i o m ett &#xF6;kat behov f&#xF6;r Sida att ut&#xF6;ka sin lokala n&#xE4;rvaro p&#xE5; Balkan efter kriget i Kosovo. Sidas bidrag uppg&#xE5;r till SEK 1 825 000</narrative>
  </description>
